  "details": "The current menu is ok for certain things, but when using the search function it tends to take a long time to load the results. Having to retype what you have searched for every time can be quite time consuming and frustrating with slow load times. For example: You're searching for a world \"avatar\" you chose to see the details of a world and decide not to go to that world. You have to retype in the search instead of just going back the previous results. It can be quite frustrating especially in VR since you have to physically point at every letter and tend to miss click often.",
